    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just heavy. i look at my life and i don't see a future, i just see a long, boring stretch of nothingness. the climb is over and there's nowhere else to go. it feels like i finished the book and now i'm just staring at the last page. what's the point in even staying for the epilogue when the story is already finished?",
